{"id":"n70796-1-11","stage":1,"title":"자꾸 · 一直","scene":"没吃午饭肚子饿","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70796-1-11-1","ko":"나 점심을 안 먹었더니 배가 자꾸 꼬르륵거려.","zh":"我中午没吃饭，肚子一直咕咕叫。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"점심을","meaning":"中饭，午饭，午餐","explanation":"점심：中饭，午饭，午餐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"1","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점심을","audio":"/audio/995779c1209c18f09c54.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"먹었더니","meaning":"没吃，所以……","explanation":"前面有 안，안 먹었더니 表示“因为没吃，结果……”；-었더니 引出亲身经历后的结果。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹었더니","audio":"/audio/11f25c19571a122b3706.mp3"}},{"text":"배가","meaning":"肚子","explanation":"배：肚子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20211","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배가","audio":"/audio/c5a9b1ff55fc80e6120e.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"不停地、老是","explanation":"자꾸：一个动作反复发生；这里指肚子一直咕咕响。","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese di